{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1320812001:1":{"text":"어, 여기도 작업 중인 인부들이 있네요.","source_cn":"咦，这里也有工人在开采呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1D2739F4B115AC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320812002:1":{"text":"이젠 더 채굴할 필요가 없을 텐데...","source_cn":"其实已经不用再开采了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5E466732A692083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320812003:1":{"text":"하하, 어떻게 굴러가는지 좀 보자고.","source_cn":"嚯嚯，我来看看进度如何。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03F2A71EA33506F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320812004:1":{"text":"진행 상황을 확인하러 왔다고? 지금 바빠 죽겠어! 작업이 이미 계획보다 한참 뒤처졌다고!","source_cn":"来查进度吗？没空！我们的作业进度已经远远落后计划了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D3A95A2BB7CEA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1320812004":{"text":"진행 상황을 확인하러 왔다고? 지금 바빠 죽겠어! 작업이 이미 계획보다 한참 뒤처졌다고!","source_cn":"来查进度吗？没空！我们的作业进度已经远远落后计划了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D3A95A2BB7CEA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docu